541
00:29:55,780 --> 00:29:58,100
for our level, we mostly
want to, and for boards,

542
00:29:58,100 --> 00:30:01,560
we mostly want to think of
tall peaked T waves being

543
00:30:01,730 --> 00:30:05,280
representative and
associated with hyperkalemia.

544
00:30:10,040 --> 00:30:14,060
So if we get peak T-waves
and hyperkalemia, then we

545
00:30:14,060 --> 00:30:17,330
must get flattened or shallow
T-waves and hypokalemia.

546
00:30:17,550 --> 00:30:19,620
Now, it may even get to
