566
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:20,700
Now, on to calcium.

567
00:31:20,920 --> 00:31:22,780
Again, as we mentioned before,

568
00:31:22,940 --> 00:31:25,540
one of the things that
we can see with increased

569
00:31:25,540 --> 00:31:29,020
electrolyte concentration
