603
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:11,560
So this is kind of a random
thing to throw in here.

604
00:33:11,560 --> 00:33:13,680
Obviously, hypothermia
is not an electrolyte

605
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:16,080
disturbance, but it does
