687
00:38:03,540 --> 00:38:08,320
you can also look up there
are specific volt amplitudes

688
00:38:08,320 --> 00:38:10,900
between leads where you
can get the summation of

689
00:38:10,900 --> 00:38:14,240
those and it'll clue you
in and fulfill one of the

